description	"Scavenger

Midgets with munitions, gadgets, and an electric blaster. Upon finding a new weapon, their flight instinct kicks in.

^2Weaponry:
- Light Melee
-- 50% faster RoF
- Short Wrench (Blue Saber)
-- No Saber/Blaster Block
-- No Saber Training
-- 300% more knockback
-- 45% shorter
-- 166% thicker
- Ion Blaster (Rifle 1)
-- Shocks on hit
-- 35% more FP drain
-- 10% faster reload
-- 20% less velocity
-- 55% slower RoF
- Trip Mine (1)
- Pulse Grenade (1)
- Pocket Sand (4) (Rock)
-- Slows on hit
-- 540% larger splash
-- Primary fire only
- Restraining Bolt (Stun Baton 1)
-- Slows/disarms on hit
-- 99% less damage/FP drain
-- 200% slower RoF
-- Heavyweight

^6Inventory:
- Seeker Drone

^8Attributes:
- Reinforcements (2)
- Dexterity (1)
- Getup (2)
- Assemble (2)
- 10% less knockback given
- 40% more knockback taken

^3Abilities:
- Dodge (3) ^3[CS1]
- Gunkick ^3[CS2/3]"